Mali g6p0 can't create dma-buf exportable images with MUTABLE_FORMAT, so
mutable format swapchains fail to initialise (e.g. Eden). Don't advertise
VK_KHR_swapchain_mutable_format; apps treat it as optional.

--- a/layer/VkLayer_window_system_integration.json
+++ b/layer/VkLayer_window_system_integration.json
@@ -88,10 +88,6 @@
             {
                 "name": "VK_KHR_present_mode_fifo_latest_ready",
                 "spec_version": "1"
-            },
-            {
-                "name": "VK_KHR_swapchain_mutable_format",
-                "spec_version": "1"
             }
         ],
         "disable_environment": {
